{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "godunov_eno1_D1",
    "description": "Pointwise per-axis quantity diff2 of NCAR fire_behavior's classical Godunov level-set option (fire_upwinding = 4) at cell (i, j), from the backward difference dl = D- u and the forward difference dr = D+ u: inside the wall band (stencils/eno1_wall_band, bdy_eno1_cells of any wall) it is the ENO1 minmod of the two (stencils/eno1_minmod), elsewhere the Godunov-upwind quantity max(dl, 0) - min(dr, 0) (stencils/godunov_upwind_D1) -- Calc_tend_ls's `use eno1 near domain boundaries` test, which precedes and overrides case (4). Both ifelse branches are three-point and evaluated on every cell (esm ifelse is not lazy); the caller keeps dl, dr in range. SIGN: the two branches disagree for a field decreasing along the axis -- ENO1 returns the signed (negative) derivative, Godunov the magnitude -D+ > 0 (fire_behavior note N44) -- exactly as the reference code does; their squares agree wherever the data are monotone or convex along the axis. Match-less helper bound by the godunov_upwind_D1x/D1y_interior stencils of this grid.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_difference",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_2d",
      "op:D",
      "axes:x,y",
      "order:1",
      "stencil_width:3"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "NCAR Community Fire Behavior Model (fire_behavior), develop @ eb77580, physics/level_set_mod.F90: Calc_tend_ls, Select_eno, Select_weno5, Select_4th, Select_godunov (case 4), Extrapol_var_at_bdys. The transcribed reference implementation."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "eno1_wall_band.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "eno1_minmod.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "godunov_upwind_D1.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "godunov_eno1_D1": {
      "params": [
        "dl",
        "dr",
        "i",
        "j"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "eno1_wall_band",
            "bindings": {
              "i": "i",
              "j": "j"
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "eno1_minmod",
            "bindings": {
              "dl": "dl",
              "dr": "dr"
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "godunov_upwind_D1",
            "bindings": {
              "dl": "dl",
              "dr": "dr"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
